<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 312.5 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 312.5 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 312.5 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID    AMOUNT		INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    26 weeks	  3.5	3.5		    8.4  pct</p>
<p>    52 weeks	250	250			9.0  pct</p>
<p>    Two years	xx	 xx			9.5  pct</p>
<p>    Five years     xx	 xx		     10.00 pct</p>
<p>    10 years	  3.0	3.0		   10.25 pct</p>
<p>    15 years	 56	 56		     10.50 pct</p>
<p>    Total	   312.5   312.5</p>
<p>($1= 8.8 dirhams)</p>
<p>-- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
</text>
